sequenceDiagram
  actor H as Human
  participant C as Codex
  participant M as Local MCP
  participant B as Call grant
  participant J as TypeSafe API
  participant R as Receipt store
  H->>B: Authorize finite attempts in private Terminal
  C->>M: jev_evaluate(case_id, approved state)
  M->>M: Validate and screen input
  M->>B: Atomically reserve one HTTP attempt
  alt Grant absent or expired
    B-->>M: Deny
    M-->>C: Safe error, no network request
  else Grant available
    M->>J: Fixed-origin HTTPS request
    J-->>M: Typed answer and usage
    M->>M: Validate answer and evaluate local policy
    M->>R: Save source-bound receipt
    M-->>C: Advisory result, no execution authorization
  end
